{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02708","headline":"卧痾喜霁开扉望月简宫内知友 · 庾抱","name":"卧痾喜霁开扉望月简宫内知友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋雨移弦望，疲痾倦苦辛。\n忽对荆山璧，委照越吟人。\n高高侵地镜，皎皎彻天津。\n色丽班姬箧，光润洛川神。\n轮辉池上动，桂影隙中新。\n怀贤虽不见，忽似暂参辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庾抱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}